  "reason": "The best accuracy found (0.725, config_010: scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted) has already been identified, and all four combinations of {transformer, avgpool} × {weighted, concat} with scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l have been tested. The remaining untested scvi_n200 multimodal configs use resnet50, which has shown ~1-2% lower accuracy (config_020: 0.713 vs config_010: 0.725). Config_030 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + avgpool + weighted) completes the 2×2 architecture grid for the resnet50 encoder, confirming that the transformer + weighted + imagenet_vit_l combination is the optimal architecture. While unlikely to surpass 0.725, it is the highest-expected-value remaining test: it uses the proven-best RNA encoder (scvi_n200) and the slightly-better weighted fusion, and provides a clean confirmation that no untested architecture variant can outperform the already-identified best configuration, solidifying the final result for this search."
}

